&lt;p&gt;You can read more about the core concepts of working on a truly distributed system in our blog post&lt;a href=&quot;https://ably.com/blog/what-is-a-distributed-systems-engineer&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
