&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anaplan is seeking a seasoned &lt;strong&gt;STRATEGIC ACCOUNT EXECUTIVE&lt;/strong&gt; to drive its growth and expand its presence in the London area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
